cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Gyre's loop patterns or vocabulary, please cite it."
title: "Gyre: Psychology-Grounded Loop Patterns for AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  Gyre is a library of loop patterns for AI agents, each grounded in a
  validated mechanism from the psychological and cybernetic literature,
  translated into an agent-engineering shape with a measurable behavioural
  signal and an explicit exit condition. It reframes the emerging practice
  of "loop engineering" as a rediscovery of cybernetic psychology, and
  offers a shared vocabulary for the loops an agent actually runs.
type: software
